  "solution": {
    "text": "Total case <math><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math><br />Favourable case <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4,1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5,2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math> cases<br />Hence, the required probability <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
